o evidence of missing files, incorrect credentials, problematic environment variables, or dependency issues during setup. The Python interpreter and libraries `requests` and `BeautifulSoup` loaded successfully. The logic of scraping code and website HTML structure are where the issues lie.\n\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

